  {
    "index": 8,
    "hash": "hCYlFTz1xOkVTMY1T2SvLhiNYBc=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-13T15:34:45.098Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_TITLE",
      "input": {
        "title": "A package's runtime shape is DocumentModelLib with manifest, documentModels, editors, and optional subgraphs, upgradeManifests, and a single processorFactory",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-13T15:34:44.000Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-13T15:34:45.098Z"
    }
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "hash": "wwGWN5O2qJFHg1qH9VXiiltqVSs=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-13T15:34:45.098Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_DESCRIPTION",
      "input": {
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-13T15:34:44.000Z",
        "description": "Not a VetraPackage with a modules wrapper. processorFactory is one builder, not an array. Connect reads via useVetraPackages; the setter is setVetraPackageManager."
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-13T15:34:45.098Z"
    }
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "hash": "SkezQZSSy6Xx2wuRWmRvOXq/bPs=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-13T15:34:45.098Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "A Powerhouse package's **runtime** shape is `DocumentModelLib` (`packages/shared/document-model/types.ts:1703`), not a `VetraPackage` with a `modules` wrapper:\n\n```typescript\ntype DocumentModelLib = {\n  manifest: Manifest;\n  documentModels: readonly DocumentModelModule[];\n  editors: readonly EditorModule[];\n  subgraphs?: readonly SubgraphModule[];\n  upgradeManifests?: readonly UpgradeManifest<readonly number[]>[];\n  processorFactory?: ProcessorFactoryBuilder;\n};\n```\n\nTwo things to note: `processorFactory` is a **single builder, not an array**, and `upgradeManifests` is a first-class member.\n\nThe **manifest** shape is `ManifestSchema` (`packages/shared/document-model/schemas.ts:908`): `name`, optional `description` / `category` / `image` / `publisher`, then `documentModels`, `apps`, `editors`, `processors`, `subgraphs`, plus optional `config` and `pwa`. Note `apps` \u2014 drive apps are a first-class manifest section.\n\nConnect reads packages via `useVetraPackages()`, which returns `DocumentModelLib[]`. The setter is `setVetraPackageManager(packageManager)` (`packages/reactor-browser/src/hooks/vetra-packages.ts:31`).\n\n**Names that do not exist in code.** `subgraphModules`, `importScriptModules` and `processorModules` all return zero hits, as does `setVetraPackages()` \u2014 the latter survives only in `apps/academy/docs/academy/04-Reference/05-EditorsUI/01-ReactHooks.md`, which documents an API the code does not have.\n\nThe registry ambition around packages \u2014 publish, discover, fork, extend, monetize, with authors sharing in value generated downstream \u2014 is unchanged.\n\n_Source-verified 2026-08-13 against Powerhouse source at v6.2.2-dev.45._",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-13T15:34:44.000Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-13T15:34:45.098Z"
    }
  },
